{
  "summary": "For a $100,000 one-time purchase, the Business Silver Rewards Card has the highest potential return, but only if Apple Music is processed under an eligible software merchant category. Because Apple Music is a streaming service, it may instead be classified as entertainment or media, in which case the enhanced rate may not apply.",
  "options": [
    {
      "card": "Business Silver Rewards Card",
      "potential_reward": "10.0% on eligible travel and software purchases; 1.0% on other purchases",
      "estimated_return_on_100000": {
        "if_coded_as_eligible_software": "$10,000",
        "if_not_coded_as_eligible_software": "$1,000"
      },
      "annual_fee": "$122.50; first-year promotional annual fee is $0",
      "credit_limit": "$17,500-$112,500, subject to approval",
      "eligibility": "Minimum personal FICO of 700; established businesses may also be evaluated using a PAYDEX score of at least 47",
      "important_note": "The merchant must process the payment under a software-related category. Rho-Bank cannot guarantee Apple Music will receive the 10% rate."
    },
    {
      "card": "Business Gold Rewards Card",
      "potential_reward": "2.5% on qualifying operations spending; 1.0% on other purchases",
      "estimated_return_on_100000": {
        "if_coded_as_qualifying_operations_spend": "$2,500",
        "if_not_coded_as_qualifying_operations_spend": "$1,000"
      },
      "annual_fee": "$200",
      "credit_limit": "$37,500-$225,000, subject to approval",
      "eligibility": "Minimum personal FICO of 735 and business PAYDEX of 67",
      "important_note": "Software subscriptions used for day-to-day operations can qualify, but the merchant category—not only the purpose of the purchase—determines the rate."
    },
    {
      "card": "Business Bronze Rewards Card",
      "potential_reward": "1.0% cash back on eligible purchases",
      "estimated_return_on_100000": "$1,000",
      "new_customer_promo": "An additional $500 statement credit after $10,000 in net new purchases within the first 2 months, if the offer is available and the purchase posts within the qualifying period",
      "total_potential_return": "$1,500",
      "annual_fee": "$0",
      "credit_limit": "Starting credit line of at least $10,000; the approved limit may not support a $100,000 single transaction",
      "eligibility": "Minimum personal FICO of 660"
    }
  ],
  "recommendation": "The Business Silver Rewards Card is the strongest candidate if Apple Music confirms that the transaction will be billed directly and coded as software. Before applying, confirm the expected merchant category and whether the card issuer will approve a credit line sufficient for the full charge. If the transaction will be classified as streaming, entertainment, or media, the documented 10% Business Silver rate is not guaranteed; the default 1% rate may apply.",
  "payment_warning": "Avoid carrying the $100,000 balance unless you have calculated the financing cost. The listed APRs range from 17.99% to 18.99% or higher depending on the card, which could substantially outweigh the rewards."
}
